.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "libmyutils Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy at most n characters of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from the string
.I src
to
.IR dest .
If
.I src
is shorter than
.I n
characters, the remainder of
.I dest
is padded with null bytes.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters actually copied from
.IR src ,
or \-1 on failure.
.SH NOTES
If
.I src
is longer than
.IR n ,
no terminating null byte is placed by this function.
